# Reserved for future macOS-only dotfiles.
#
# The darwin/ snippet directory at the repo root is still sourced via the
# .bashrc loop (and zprofile loop) and is NOT stowed. This package exists so
# that `stow macos` is a valid target once macOS-specific dotfiles (files that
# should be symlinked into $HOME) are added. Until then it contains only this
# placeholder.
